{
  "$comment": "Card registry. One card per function: a kind's main card is named as the kind (light, cover...), its other cards kind.name (scene.bar, room.card); what a device can do (dimming, colours, tilt, speeds) comes from Home Assistant, what the installer chooses is an option. Sizes are in cells of the fine grid (12x8 on a 10\" panel, each a quarter of the 6x4 grid's cell). free_size: any WxH from min_size up to the grid (12x8), vertical ones too (2x6...), the content fitted to the space; sizes are only presets. Apps reading layout format 3 get cards.v3.json, in the 6x4 grid's cells. The add-on validates layouts against it and builds the editor's card picker and property fields from it; the app mirrors the kinds in CardKind.kt (a unit test keeps them in step). entities.domains '*' accepts any domain. Options of type 'entity' must be named *_entity. An option with 'requires' is offered only for a card of one device that can do it (dimming: a light with a colour mode other than on/off; plain: a light with no white tones or colours of its own; speeds: a fan with HA's SET_SPEED feature).",
  "version": 3,
  "sizes": [
    "1x1",
    "2x1",
    "2x2",
    "4x2",
    "4x4",
    "6x4",
    "8x4"
  ],
  "targets": [
    "android",
    "esp32",
    "phone"
  ],
  "kinds": {
    "light": {
      "domains": [
        "light"
      ],
      "default": "light",
      "controllable": true
    },
    "switch": {
      "domains": [
        "switch",
        "input_boolean"
      ],
      "default": "switch",
      "controllable": true
    },
    "cover": {
      "domains": [
        "cover"
      ],
      "default": "cover",
      "controllable": true
    },
    "climate": {
      "domains": [
        "climate"
      ],
      "default": "climate",
      "controllable": true
    },
    "fan": {
      "domains": [
        "fan"
      ],
      "default": "fan",
      "controllable": true
    },
    "lock": {
      "domains": [
        "lock"
      ],
      "default": "lock",
      "controllable": true
    },
    "scene": {
      "domains": [
        "scene"
      ],
      "default": "scene",
      "controllable": true
    },
    "script": {
      "domains": [
        "script"
      ],
      "default": "script",
      "controllable": true
    },
    "button": {
